import Erdos1.Resolutions.Erdos1_219usd_38h

/-!
# Erdős problem #1: disproof

Library root. It imports the primary resolution `Erdos1.Resolutions.Erdos1_219usd_38h`, the file
produced in the FrontierMath Erdős benchmark, which proves `Erdos1.erdos_1.disproof`.

The further resolutions in `Erdos1/Resolutions/` (`Erdos1_735usd_86h`) are
independent proofs of the same statement. Each is a self-contained copy of the benchmark
statement preamble followed by its own proof, so they are built as the separate library
`Erdos1Alternates` and deliberately not imported here.
-/
